  "id": "siam",
  "city": "bangkok",
  "name": {
    "en": "Siam and Pratunam"
  },
  "tagline": {
    "en": "Malls, markets and the BTS interchange. Shop and move anywhere fast."
  },
  "about": {
    "en": "Siam is where the BTS Sukhumvit and Silom lines cross, which makes it the easiest base for moving around the city. Siam Square and the malls along Rama I Road (Siam Paragon, MBK, CentralWorld) sit around the interchange; Ratchaprasong is the hotel-and-shrine corner to the east; Pratunam, north across the canal, is wholesale clothing stalls under the Baiyoke tower. Expect crowds, air conditioning and short walks between everything."
  },
